dren":[{"type":"text","value":"options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AudioActivityOptions"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TAdapter"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TStream"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AudioActivityResult"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TStream"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Generate music from a prompt"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { generateAudio } from '@tanstack/ai'\nimport { falAudio } from '@tanstack/ai-fal'\n\nconst result = await generateAudio({\n  adapter: falAudio('fal-ai/diffrhythm'),\n  prompt: 'An upbeat electronic track with synths',\n  duration: 10\n})\n\nconsole.log(result.audio.url) // URL to generated audio","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tadapter","text":"TAdapter","level":3},{"id":"tstream","text":"TStream","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"options","text":"options","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction generateAudio<TAdapter, TStream>(options): AudioActivityResult<TStream>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/generateAudio/index.ts:154](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/generateAudio/index.ts#L154)\n\nAudio generation activity - generates audio from text prompts.\n\nUses AI models to create music, sound effects, and other audio content.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TAdapter\n\n`TAdapter` *extends* [`AudioAdapter`](../interfaces/AudioAdapter.md)\\<`string`, `AudioProviderOptions`\\<`TAdapter`\\>\\>\n\n### TStream\n\n`TStream` *extends* `boolean` = `false`\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n`AudioActivityOptions`\\<`TAdapter`, `TStream`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`AudioActivityResult`\\<`TStream`\\>\n\n## Example\n\n**Generate music from a prompt**\n\n```ts\nimport { generateAudio } from '@tanstack/ai'\nimport { falAudio } from '@tanstack/ai-fal'\n\nconst result = await generateAudio({\n  adapter: falAudio('fal-ai/diffrhythm'),\n  prompt: 'An upbeat electronic track with synths',\n  duration: 10\n})\n\nconsole.log(result.audio.url) // URL to generated audio\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: generateAudio\ntitle: generateAudio\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction generateAudio<TAdapter, TStream>(options): AudioActivityResult<TStream>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/generateAudio/index.ts:154](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/generateAudio/index.ts#L154)\n\nAudio generation activity - generates audio from text prompts.\n\nUses AI models to create music, sound effects, and other audio content.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TAdapter\n\n`TAdapter` *extends* [`AudioAdapter`](../interfaces/AudioAdapter.md)\\<`string`, `AudioProviderOptions`\\<`TAdapter`\\>\\>\n\n### TStream\n\n`TStream` *extends* `boolean` = `false`\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n`AudioActivityOptions`\\<`TAdapter`, `TStream`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`AudioActivityResult`\\<`TStream`\\>\n\n## Example\n\n**Generate music from a prompt**\n\n```ts\nimport { generateAudio } from '@tanstack/ai'\nimport { falAudio } from '@tanstack/ai-fal'\n\nconst result = await generateAudio({\n  adapter: falAudio('fal-ai/diffrhythm'),\n  prompt: 'An upbeat electronic track with synths',\n  duration: 10\n})\n\nconsole.log(result.audio.url) // URL to generated audio\n```\n"}
